byerr@netcom.com (Richard E. Byer) writes...
>I remember hearing that the vibrating square was confined to a certain 
>rectangle on the screen.  Where?
>Also,  how do I use the items on the square when I find it?
> 
>I am not having fun looking for the square!

The items, when applied in the proper order when standing on the square,
levels the dungeon around you to form a rectangle 13 squares wide by 11
squares tall centered on you.  No part of this rectangle will go off the
screen, so you don't need to search near the edges of the screen, and the 
up staircase will not be within the rectangle, so you don't need to search
near the up staircase.

As to the order that the items need to be applied in, I'll let you discover
that by trial and error, like I did.  Nothing bad happens if you get them
out of order, and there are only nine possible combinations.

